# OpenPOS Desktop environment template
#
# The web build always calls the API on its own origin (/api). Locally, Vite
# proxies /api to the API from `pnpm run dev`; on Cloudflare the web Worker
# forwards it.
#
# Optional. Where Vite proxies /api in web dev (default http://localhost:3001).
# VITE_DEV_API_PROXY=http://localhost:3001
#
# Optional. API origin for Electron dev builds. Packaged installs default to
# https://api.pos.softmelody.dev and read apiUrl from Electron userData config.json.
# VITE_API_URL=https://api.pos.softmelody.dev
